~ platformGotchas
-   null
+   "Windows: with Git for Windows the Bash tool uses Git Bash (set CLAUDE_CODE_GIT_BASH_PATH if not found) and the PowerShell tool is also on by default for claude.ai and Console accounts, and when it is enabled Claude treats PowerShell as the primary shell (changelog 2.1.126); without it the PowerShell tool is the shell. Native Windows has no sandboxing (WSL 2 does). WinGet upgrades can fail while claude runs (locked executable). Linux binaries are not individually code-signed: verify with the signed manifest or use apt/dnf/apk."
~ purpose
-   null
+   "Anthropic's agentic coding CLI (claude). It is the primary agent runtime of the aitools harness: aitools install deploys its user configuration (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, rules, skills, hooks, settings.json, MCP servers) and the harness hooks (session archive, harvesting, standing-order and delegation guards) run inside its sessions. Managed so every machine runs a current, verified build with the same harness behaviour."
